{"candidateAnswer":"Around the middle of 2022","evidence":"[D25:9 | 8:56 pm on 20 September, 2022] John: Thanks James! I kept it a secret because I would have been very upset if I had told you about her in advance and then it wouldn't have worked out. I've been working on this for the past few months and I'm really proud of how it's turned out. It's a 2D adventure game with puzzles and exploration. Here's a screenshot.","itemId":"urn:uuid:99647366-29ab-58cd-bba8-3ccc5ef09420","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a521be66bcea2f46db6b11c6fc0848a4ab2bc3dd4faf4155502311f4c64ce5d8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John start working on his 2D Adventure mobile game?","referenceAnswer":"approximately summer of 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a521be66bcea2f46db6b11c6fc0848a4ab2bc3dd4faf4155502311f4c64ce5d8"}}]}